'''Kaioh Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event/Event Gacha|Event Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 797
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Kaioh Cat
|name2 = Kaioh Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kaioh Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kaioh Cat's usage is severely undermined by their unreasonably long recharge time. As a unit, they can be decent in early [[Stories of Legend]], but beyond that point they tend to be to be outperformed by more spammable options like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Commando Cat]] (and eventually Cameraman Cat). Against Dark enemies it's a similar story, but with [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]], especially when [[Talents|Talented]].

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & User Rank Dump}}

