==Trivia==
*In ''[[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Baki]]'', 海王 ''Kaiō'' is normally romanized as [[wikia:baki:Kaiou|Kaiou]], yet the collab in [[The Battle Cats]] has it romanized as Kaioh, possibly to avoid confusion with the stage [[Kaiou (Cats of the Cosmos)|Kaiou]].
*Kaioh Cat's Normal Form descriptions reference [[wikipedia:Dorodango|dorodangos]], polished balls of mud that are infamously fragile.

